0	159	Michael McGrath (; born 23 August 1976) is an Irish Fianna Fáil politician and EU Commissioner for Democracy, Justice, the Rule of Law and Consumer Protection.
160	302	He previously served as Minister for Finance from December 2022 to June 2024 and Minister for Public Expenditure and Reform from 2020 to 2022.
303	391	He was a Teachta Dála (TD) for the Cork South-Central constituency from 2007 to 2024.



